Replace this file with the upstream license text, verbatim.

Do not paraphrase it and do not write a summary here, copy the license as the authors
published it. The `license` field in index.md is a machine-readable shorthand; this file
is the actual grant, and it is what someone will read if the question is ever contested.

If the upstream project has no license file, delete this file and set
license = "NOASSERTION" in index.md. That is the honest answer, and it is better than
guessing.
